 and fifth i always like  to say again always try to do more than  one type of physical activity such you  know as those aerobics and muscle  strengthening definitely want to do more  than one let's expand on that what are  some more non-sports related activities  that people could do  um dancing you know i know a lot of  folks that love dancing uh whether it's  at a community center or at a friend's  house or in your own living room dancing  is always a great way to get some  activity in window shopping which is one  of my personal favorites you don't have  to have to go out there right you don't  have to go out there to spend but uh you  can definitely get those steps in at the  mall garden on your patio  call a friend or a family member  sometimes it's the social interaction  that you need just as much as the  physical interaction  play a game of cards do a puzzle read a  book all of those things are really  really going to help you stay connected  and and increase your your mental health  and stability so tell us what is  southwest medical doing to promote  physical activity  yeah southwest medical has partnered  with the op and care community center  which has locations conveniently located  on the east side and the west side of  the las vegas valley these locations  offer physical activities yoga line  dancing in addition to social activities  such as bingo and cooking demonstrations  thank you to southwest medical  associates for sponsoring this segment  locations across southern nevada like  she said  702-877-5199 is the number you call for  more information or you can visit  smalv.com we'll be right back
 

